<title>USA: Indium Corp hikes price by $30 to $290 per kilo.</title>
<headline>Indium Corp hikes price by $30 to $290 per kilo.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indium Corp of America said it will raise its indium price by $30 to $290 per kilogram or $9.02 per troy ounce, effective March 20.</p>
<p>The company last raised its prices on March 6 by $35, and on Feb 26 by $15.</p>
<p>Indium prices have rebounded recently, helped by Chinese producers overselling or hoarding stocks in hope of higher prices, traders said earlier this month.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
